.*
!.gitignore
obj
log
gen
*.o
*.elf
BUILD_NUMBER
# Generated at build time from the extracted firmware blobs. The numbered
# variants (templateram0.c, ucode1_compressed.c, ...) come from the
# multi-template chips such as bcm4375b1 and bcm43439a0; listing only the
# plain names left those showing up as untracked source after every build.
ucode*_compressed.c
templateram*.c
*.bin
# Patched firmware images and the generated C-style firmware header. The *.bin
# rule above does not match the suffixed outputs the patch step writes
# (bcmdhd_sta.bin_b1, w43439A0_..._combined.h).
*.bin_*
*_combined.h
